  "historyNote": "#2297, eff 2-7-83; ss by #2704, eff 5-9-84; ss by #3143, eff 11-4-85 (formerly Saf-S 1003.05) New. #4862, eff 7-10-90; ss by #6284, eff 7-10-96; ss by #7800, eff 12-11-02, EXPIRED: 12-11-10 New. #10072, eff 1-11-12; ss by #13429-B, eff 8-6-22 (formerly Pas 303.05)",
